{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-339",
  "title": "[ SPEC TEMPLATE ]",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[ SPEC TEMPLATE ]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Develop ${PROJECT_NAME}, a ${PROJECT_DESCRIPTION}. It should allow users to ${CORE_FUNCTIONALITY}. In this initial phase for this feature, let's call it \"${PHASE_NAME},\" let's have ${USER_SETUP_DESCRIPTION}."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User Configuration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I want ${TOTAL_USER_COUNT} users in ${USER_CATEGORY_COUNT} different categories: ${USER_CATEGORIES_AND_COUNTS}. Let's create ${PROJECT_COUNT} different sample projects."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Board Structure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let's have the ${BOARD_TYPE} columns for the status of each task, such as ${COLUMN_NAMES}."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Authentication"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "There will be ${AUTHENTICATION_SETUP} for this application as this is ${AUTHENTICATION_REASON}."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Task Card Features"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For each task in the UI for a task card, you should be able to:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "${TASK_CARD_FEATURES}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User Flow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When you first launch ${PROJECT_NAME}, it's going to ${INITIAL_SCREEN_BEHAVIOR}. ${LOGIN_FLOW_DESCRIPTION}."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When you click on a user, you go into the main view, which displays ${MAIN_VIEW_CONTENT}. When you click on a project, you open ${PROJECT_VIEW_DESCRIPTION}."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Board Interaction"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You're going to see the columns. You'll be able to ${BOARD_INTERACTION_FEATURES}."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Visual Indicators"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You will see ${VISUAL_INDICATORS} so you can quickly ${VISUAL_INDICATOR_PURPOSE}."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Permission System"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You can ${USER_PERMISSIONS_OWN_CONTENT}, but you can't ${USER_PERMISSIONS_OTHERS_CONTENT}."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Template Variables Reference"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Project Identity"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${PROJECT_NAME}` - Name of the application/project"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${PROJECT_DESCRIPTION}` - Brief description of what the project is"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${PHASE_NAME}` - Name of the current development phase"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${CORE_FUNCTIONALITY}` - Main features the application should provide"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Users & Roles"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${TOTAL_USER_COUNT}` - Total number of users (e.g., \"five\")"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${USER_CATEGORY_COUNT}` - Number of different user types (e.g., \"two\")"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${USER_CATEGORIES_AND_COUNTS}` - Description of user roles and quantities"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${USER_SETUP_DESCRIPTION}` - How users are configured/managed"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Project Structure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${PROJECT_COUNT}` - Number of sample projects to create"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${BOARD_TYPE}` - Type of board layout (e.g., \"standard Kanban\")"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${COLUMN_NAMES}` - List of column names in quotes"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Authentication & Access"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${AUTHENTICATION_SETUP}` - Authentication requirements"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${AUTHENTICATION_REASON}` - Explanation for auth setup choice"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${INITIAL_SCREEN_BEHAVIOR}` - What happens on app launch"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${LOGIN_FLOW_DESCRIPTION}` - How users log in or select themselves"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Interface & Navigation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${MAIN_VIEW_CONTENT}` - What's shown in the main view after login"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-49",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${PROJECT_VIEW_DESCRIPTION}` - What opens when clicking on a project"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Features & Interactions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-52",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${TASK_CARD_FEATURES}` - List of task card capabilities"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-53",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${BOARD_INTERACTION_FEATURES}` - What users can do with the board"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-54",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${VISUAL_INDICATORS}` - Visual cues for users"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-55",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${VISUAL_INDICATOR_PURPOSE}` - What the visual cues help accomplish"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Permissions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${USER_PERMISSIONS_OWN_CONTENT}` - What users can do with their own content"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-59",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "`${USER_PERMISSIONS_OTHERS_CONTENT}` - What users cannot do with others' content"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}